      "uco-core:name": "Greggy's Cult",
      "uco-core:description": "Association-in-fact enterprise charged under 18 U.S.C. § 2252A(g). An Internet-based group that operated in or about and between 2019 and 2021 throughout the United States, including in the Eastern District of New York. The indictment pleads a series of felony violations constituting three or more separate incidents involving more than one victim, committed in concert with three or more persons. It alleges no organizational hierarchy and identifies no leader; paragraph 7 describes members working together and individually for the benefit of the enterprise. Source: PACER Doc 8 (redacted indictment), paras. 1-7 and Count One.",
